OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1791977190
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAReservoir falls below 17% as
OL,4,Adrought persists
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth East Water operations director
OL,7,FDouglas Whitfield said Ardingly
OL,8,FReservoir in West Sussex had fallen
OL,9,Fbelow 17% and the company was
OL,10,Fmonitoring levels daily to protect as
OL,11,Fmuch water as possible.
OL,13,FHe said a wet winter had been forecast
OL,14,Fbut timings were not clear and the
OL,15,Fcompany was making any adjustments it
OL,16,Fcould to protect supplies until the
OL,17,Fexpected rainfall.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
